["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"126. 和红杉郑庆生聊：经济史的流量革命、人类行为模式的不可预期，与创始人性格 双边网络效应 PMF 幸存者偏差\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-21-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代的网络没有自然垄断-边际成本不趋近于零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/49045e811e1dea1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1221</span></div>\n<h2>AI 时代的网络没有自然垄断，边际成本不趋近于零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互联网产品是巨大的城镇，边际成本趋近于零所以赢家通吃；AI 每多一个用户就多一份 token 成本，这个差别会改写流量节点的商业设计。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 投资</span><span class=\"tag\">流量</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"导演大鹏×罗永浩！我这两辈子\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-17-cn2d7912-大鹏-我好像活了两辈子-上辈子总被保安轰-被粉丝踩/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/225eff6d82f85e3d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">5:02:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1217</span></div>\n<h2>大鹏：我好像活了两辈子，上辈子总被保安轰、被粉丝踩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大鹏说自己好像活了两辈子：上一辈子他穿短裤在电影节红毯尽头被保安呵斥、在直播现场被粉丝踩在脚底下；这一辈子他走红毯、领奖，迎面喊他名字的还是当年那群记者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人物访谈</span><span class=\"tag\">创业者成长</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"125. Freda的投资札记第1集：下注OpenAI、Robinhood往事，美国资本坏小孩、算盘与泡沫 Crossover Scaling Law Single GM Prediction Market Agentic Commerce Neo Labs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-16-zhangxiaojun-openai-的商业模式是负向滚雪球-越烧越亏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f93330d12f4107e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1216</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 的商业模式是负向滚雪球，越烧越亏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司每年要拿上一年的训练成本乘以十去烧下一代模型，收入却只按上一年的两倍回收，加 2 减 10，现金流年年更负。只有停止烧钱那天，利润表才会突然好看。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"124. 雨森的创投观察第1集：2026年预期、The Year of R、回调、我们如何下注 Year of R New Labs proactive agent Remote Labor Index OOD\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-13-zhangxiaojun-2026-是回报之年-模型没有秘密-应用才有护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9da6aa992d11d172-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:23:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1213</span></div>\n<h2>2026 是回报之年：模型没有秘密，应用才有护城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型能力进步在放缓，中国开源模型把差距压到 6-12 个月，API 生意没有垄断性壁垒；真正值钱的是模型之外那层 context、工具和环境。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 投资</span><span class=\"tag\">模型护城河</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"123. 对ONE2X创始人王冠3小时访谈：生成系统、没有中间商赚差价、内容平台的权力分配 DSL System 1 / System 2 Context Engineering prosumer reward function\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-12-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代的公司最终都是生成系统公司-中间商会被干掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/892c212740d3e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:42:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1212</span></div>\n<h2>AI 时代的公司最终都是生成系统公司，中间商会被干掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互联网平台靠分配权剥削生产端，同样的内容不同人发量不一样，说明分配机制失效。生成系统把分配内化，直接连接需求和生产，产销合一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生成系统</span><span class=\"tag\">数据飞轮</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"MiniMax 创始人闫俊杰×罗永浩！大山并非无法翻越 Scaling Law AGI Exploration/Exploitation MOE OpenRouter\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-10-cn2d7912-缩放定律最早在百度被发现-但做出gpt的却是美国公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ffd4880abb9af1d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:50:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1210</span></div>\n<h2>缩放定律最早在百度被发现，但做出GPT的却是美国公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">MiniMax创始人严俊杰说，奠定大模型根基的缩放定律2014年就已经在百度被发现，但真正做出GPT的却是没有历史包袱的美国创业公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">成本结构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"122. 朱啸虎现实主义故事的第三次连载：人工智能的盛筵与泡泡 Club Deal Dark Fiber SOTA Token\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-09-zhangxiaojun-ai-三年内看不到泡沫-但-vc-共识太集中才是真风险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b9b598ea05f613e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">48:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1209</span></div>\n<h2>AI 三年内看不到泡沫，但 VC 共识太集中才是真风险</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱啸虎说泡沫论是二级市场投资人在故意引导回调，真正的问题是一级市场每个项目都成了 Club Deal，GP 赚不了大钱、LP 也不开心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"121. 对DeepMind谭捷的访谈：机器人、跨本体、世界模型、Gemini Robotics 1.5和Google VLA cross embodiment transfer motion transfer sim to real egocentric video embodiment gap\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-11-28-zhangxiaojun-机器人最大的瓶颈不是算法-是数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/946401201b99ef46-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1128</span></div>\n<h2>机器人最大的瓶颈不是算法，是数据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">谭捷在 Google DeepMind 做了十年机器人，他的判断是：机器人基座模型至今还不是独立学科，只是多模态大模型的微调；真正的瓶颈是数据，而摇操采数据不是终局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"导演毕赣×罗永浩！清醒、深刻、独一无二的造梦者\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-11-28-cn2d7912-路边野餐开场沉闷不是失误-而是让观众像爬山一样抵达日出/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e517097b0b03288b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:20:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1128</span></div>\n<h2>路边野餐开场沉闷不是失误，而是让观众像爬山一样抵达日出</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">毕赣说真正尊重观众，是尊重观众的潜意识而非喜好：前半段的障碍不会被剪掉，因为翻过障碍抵达的震撼，和直接到达完全是两回事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">长镜头</span><span class=\"tag\">文艺片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"何同学×罗永浩！青年何同学的骄傲与烦恼 MVP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-11-20-cn2d7912-何同学海外视频播放破千万-半年youtube收入仅2万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0106480d1afb6af1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:30:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>何同学海外视频播放破千万，半年YouTube收入仅2万美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">外界曾传闻英文频道靠YouTube分成年入百万到千万，何同学亲口澄清：做了半年总收入只有两万美元，长视频一期也就两三千美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自媒体创业</span><span class=\"tag\">内容选题</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"120. 小鹏新上任的刘先明首次访谈：Language是毒药、拆掉L、简单即美、换帅、小鹏的AI转型 VLA Latent COT scaling Physical AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-11-18-zhangxiaojun-小鹏拆掉语言模型-language-是毒药-简单即美/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1e2c3717dde66c36-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>小鹏拆掉语言模型：Language 是毒药，简单即美</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鹏自动驾驶新负责人刘先明把 VLA 里的 Language 拆掉，用 27 万到 30 万小时纯视觉数据直接输出控制信号，因为 Language 是离散的、低效的，会成为数据规模化的瓶颈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">VLA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"魔术大师刘谦×罗永浩！你所不知道的刘谦 misdirection Force Crossing Card Force 巴格拉斯效应\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-11-11-cn2d7912-魔术师手速快不是真相-靠的是转移你的注意力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e93f477040d6a053-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">4:28:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>魔术师手速快不是真相，靠的是转移你的注意力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">刘谦说「手速快」是魔术师自古编造出来掩盖真相的说法，真正的核心技术是misdirection，把观众的注意力和思维同时引开。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">魔术</span><span class=\"tag\">misdirection</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"119. Kimi Linear、Minimax M2？和杨松琳考古算法变种史，并预演未来架构改进方案 Linear Attention KDA Delta Rule Sparse Attention Sliding Window Attention Scaling Ladder\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-11-03-zhangxiaojun-纯线性注意力不-work-3-比-1-混合才是共识/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8af4f82306c1b043-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>纯线性注意力不 work，3 比 1 混合才是共识</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">纯 Linear Attention 有根本缺陷，下限无保证；Kimi、千问都收敛到每 3 层线性插 1 层全局注意力，而 MiniMax 从 M1 退回 Full Attention 是因为评测漏了多跳推理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">线性注意力</span><span class=\"tag\">模型架构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"118. 对李想的第二次3小时访谈：CEO大模型、MoE、梁文锋、VLA、能量、记忆、对抗人性、亲密关系、人类的智慧 VLA MoE AgentOS RLHF 世界模型\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-30-zhangxiaojun-李想-通用-agent-五年内不会出现-只会先有-agentos/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a2c96d240eb08aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:46:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>李想：通用 agent 五年内不会出现，只会先有 agentOS</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李想判断通用 agent 五年内不会出现，真正会出现的是 agentOS——各专业在上面开发自己的专业 agent。因为生产工具必须能行动、能替代专业工作，而不是给个建议。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">VLA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"贾樟柯×罗永浩！成为贾樟柯（上）\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-29-cn2d7912-一次被放鸽子的下午-一场电影决定了贾樟柯要去拍电影/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9972a3ea5b348a4e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:45:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>一次被放鸽子的下午，一场电影决定了贾樟柯要去拍电影</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一次赴约被放鸽子后，贾樟柯在电影院偶然看到《黄土地》,发现自己最熟悉却视而不见的家乡生活原来可以被电影这样讲述，当场决定要去拍电影。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">贾樟柯</span><span class=\"tag\">导演成长</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"117. 开源一段论文探索之旅：模型范式、Infra和数据、语言、多模态的完整变迁史 MFU MOE COT LoRA RLHF 光流\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-28-zhangxiaojun-模型是炼油厂-第一阶段的赢家不是最后的赢家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a079c1aa86947eb7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">4:22:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>模型是炼油厂：第一阶段的赢家不是最后的赢家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">商业史上第一波跑出来的公司几乎从不是下个阶段的赢家。模型公司是提炼基础油的炼油厂，值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">论文精读</span><span class=\"tag\">模型范式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"名创优品叶国富×罗永浩！重塑线下购物，让人们重新爱上逛街！ SKU fine dining\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-22-cn2d7912-名创优品老板-超市只分两种-卖产品的活-卖货架的死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c387de8b2a7bb5e5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:54:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>名创优品老板：超市只分两种，卖产品的活，卖货架的死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">叶国富说，山姆和胖东来靠做好产品活下来，其他超市靠进场费、上架费赚钱，这套逻辑正是他收购永辉、复制胖东来模式的全部依据。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">线下零售</span><span class=\"tag\">IP运营</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"宋方金×罗永浩！故事必须有人讲下去 science fiction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-17-cn2d7912-编剧不该怕机器人像人-该怕人越来越像机器人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3d1f8cd96251a093-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">5:22:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>编剧不该怕机器人像人，该怕人越来越像机器人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">宋方金说现在的AI写故事大纲已经超过六成编剧，真正的危机不是技术取代创作，而是创作者早已把自己写成套路机器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">影视行业</span><span class=\"tag\">编剧生态</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"影视飓风TIM×罗永浩！用影像打开世界的梦想家 OKR ENTP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-10-cn2d7912-做内容赚不到规模化的钱-靠卖t恤一年卖出上百万件/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8526f00042d68a45-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:51:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>做内容赚不到规模化的钱，靠卖T恤一年卖出上百万件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">影视飓风内容本身没有规模效应，一期视频赚一期的钱；真正能复制、能卖出几十万到上百万件的是T恤和冲锋衣，这才是支撑公司的生意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自媒体变现</span><span class=\"tag\">内容规模化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"116. 吴明辉口述19年史：漫长的沉浮、痛苦急转、企业级Agentic Model、现实世界的数值游戏、IPO agentic model pass@1 MOA context\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-09-zhangxiaojun-模型是炼油厂-值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bb4fc975caeda4bd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:47:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>模型是炼油厂，值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基础模型只要有两家以上就不可能赚钱，会像电价一样被卷成电费；真正的壁垒是别人没存下来的 context 数据，以及大厂因为晋升机制永远做不了的最后一公里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业级AI</span><span class=\"tag\">数据壁垒</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"周鸿祎×罗永浩！周鸿祎深度谈 AI！近四小时高密度输出 AGI PMF MCP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-09-24-cn2d7912-ai没法像互联网一样免费-因为token成本只增不减/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/244c36d13df4d6ea-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:32:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI没法像互联网一样免费，因为token成本只增不减</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">做一个10分钟视频要烧掉约1000万token、花10到20块钱——周鸿祎认为任务越复杂AI的边际成本越高，靠广告或免费换规模的老路走不通，收费是迟早的事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI商业模式</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"115. 对OpenAI姚顺雨3小时访谈：6年Agent研究、人与系统、吞噬的边界、既单极又多元的世界 pass@k pass^k affordance memory hierarchy intrinsic reward\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-09-11-zhangxiaojun-ai-下半场-通用方法已经有了-难的是找任务/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfbf7de74c2135f3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:31:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 下半场：通用方法已经有了，难的是找任务</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">姚顺雨说 AI 主线已从「造武器」进入「选战场」——方法终于通用了，但真正的瓶颈不是推理能力，而是模型拿不到人脑子里的 context。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"五条人之仁科×罗永浩！近五个小时的变态超长对谈！ X先生 时光列车 迪伦精神\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-09-10-cn2d7912-土味美学不是设计出来的-而是贫穷生活里自然长出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/78ad6d4d665acca7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">4:37:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>土味美学不是设计出来的，而是贫穷生活里自然长出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说这套土味美学不是提前设计的风格策略，而是像希腊神庙的柱子褪色一样，被贫穷岁月自然磨出来的真实。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">独立音乐</span><span class=\"tag\">乡土美学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"114. 与殷一、欧迪聊聊萨洛蒙：中国意外的增长阀门、小众越野跑与少女故事 the winning moments OOTD repeat traffic\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-09-06-zhangxiaojun-越野跑核心人群十年没变-萨洛蒙靠女性破了圈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2776969c0511e305-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>越野跑核心人群十年没变，萨洛蒙靠女性破了圈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国越野跑核心人群十年前十万人，今年还是十万人，区别是老了十岁。萨洛蒙没丢专业线，靠女性拉新把会员从十万做到八百万。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">户外运动</span>\n</div></div></a>"]